WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Editing day.

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:03.470
Read each date and place.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.090
Is there a comma between the day and the year?

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:10.170
Between the town and the bigger place?

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:14.680
And if the sentence keeps going, is there a comma after?

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.020
Fix each one and say what it separates.
